WEBVTT

00:55:28.079 --> 00:55:32.996
a worse place? But the incentive systems
that we're in are so powerful.

00:55:33.163 --> 00:55:35.163
And even those engineers who join with

00:55:35.163 --> 00:55:39.413
the absolute best of intentions get sucked
into this world where they're like

00:55:39.413 --> 00:55:44.163
trying to go up from it all for and five
or whatever Facebook calls those things

00:55:44.163 --> 00:55:46.288
and you like, it's pretty exciting.

00:55:46.288 --> 00:55:47.704
You get caught up playing the game,

00:55:47.704 --> 00:55:51.329
you're rewarded for kind of doing things
that move the company's key metrics.

00:55:51.538 --> 00:55:52.996
It's like fun to get promoted.

00:55:52.996 --> 00:55:58.704
It feels good to make more money and the
incentive systems of the company.

00:55:58.704 --> 00:55:59.788
And that's what it rewards.

00:55:59.788 --> 00:56:03.746
An individual performance are maybe
like not what we all want.